# Virtual Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Python Bytecode & Caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Environment Variables & Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Runtime Artifacts, Logs & Outputs
logs/
*.log
runs/
reports/
data/
!data/.gitkeep

# Local Helper Scripts & OS Files
AnacondaHere.bat
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE & Editor Settings
.vscode/
.idea/
.cursor/
*.swp
*.swo
```[cite: 1]

---

### Notes on Specific Folders
* **`data/`, `runs/`, `reports/`, `logs/`**: Ignored by default so generated outputs, telemetry logs, and local datasets don't bloat your repository. If you have static input files in `data/` that you *do* want tracked, remove `data/` from the list or selectively un-ignore them using `!data/your_file.json`[cite: 1].
* **`ui/` and `adk_ui/`**: If either of these contains a Node/React frontend, add `node_modules/`, `dist/`, and `.next/` to the file as well[cite: 1].